  "headline": "Disaster Victim Identification Identifies 12 PT Fonusa Agung Mulia",
  "seoTitle": "12 PT Fonusa Agung Mulia Victims Identified",
  "metaDescription": "The joint Disaster Victim Identification team has successfully identified 12 victims following the fatal fire at the PT Fonusa Agung Mulia factory.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "A joint DVI team identified 12 deceased individuals from the factory fire.",
    "Search operations for victims at the site have been extended by three days.",
    "Local government officials plan to evaluate safety compliance at the facility."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Disaster Victim Identification (DVI) team has confirmed the identities of 12 individuals who perished in the fire at the PT Fonusa Agung Mulia candy factory in Cikande, Serang, Banten. This follows a broader search operation for victims that had previously been extended by three days due to challenging conditions, including hazardous debris and adverse weather. Authorities have reported that at least 27 victims have been recovered in total as of recent updates. Following the incident, the local government has announced plans to conduct a formal evaluation regarding occupational health and safety standards at the facility, as well as an investigation into the root causes of the fire. Compensation processes for the heirs of the deceased have also been initiated, with reports citing survivor benefits provided to affected families.",
